window.products.push({"id":1100100,"name":"FurRain Pie Weights for Baking, Ceramic Pie Weight Baking Beads 10mm Baking Beans Pie Crust Weights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H4FW45VmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【MAKE SMOOTHY PIE CURST】The pie weights as ceramic baking beans are great helpers for blind baking. Prevent the pie crust from forming air pockets that bubble up or shrinking when baking. They weight down the dough so that hold the pie shape and stays firmly nestled against the pie pan. No more big air bubbles, perfect smoothy pie crust for filling. 【WHY CHOOSE US】These Pie Weights Beans are made of food grade ceramic stoneware. Burnt in 2200℉ kiln, does not encompass any harmful substance or odor. Heat resistant up to 480-degrees. They are reusable, high intensity structure, rock hard and solid, durable for years, better than other types of baking beans. So easy to make a perfect pie crust. The container is food grade wheat straw with eco-friendly and easy to use for storing these pie weights. 【SIZE】These pie weights for baking and container are 1.4 lb (640g). Suitable for 6 to 9.5 inch pie crust. These pie weights for baking can bake a perfect pie crust for classic apple pie, banana cream & chocolate cream pie, lemon meringue, strawberry rhubarb pie, banoffee pie and other pastry. 【STEPS FOR USAGE】The pie weights should be cleaned by water in the First Use and need drying. Baking Parchment Paper need be placed on the pie crust before pouring on the pie weights. After using, cleaning and drying before storing. More detailed steps can be seen in the detailed description. 【You'll wonder how you ever managed without them】The pie crust with bubbles will bring a lot of inconvenience when filling the jam or others. A perfect pie needs a smooth pie crust. With these ceramic pie weights for baking, you can complete the most important step of a perfect pie.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H4FW45VmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FurRain","source_asin":"B083NSCLQD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083NSCLQD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083NSCLQD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
