window.products.push({"id":1100142,"name":"LONONE Dehumidifier - 31oz(900ml) Portable and Ultra Quiet Small Dehumidifiers with Colorful LED Light, 2200 Cubic Feet Compact Mini Air for Home Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610JoG70hSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you ever have that damp feeling, whether the air is too hot or too damp, you shouldn’t have to settle for anything less than “just right.” ➤Relax! The dehumidifier have your health and comfort covered --- Create a healthy and comfortable environment around you!✿By removing excess moisture, reduce the humidity rate in any part of your place, our dehumidifiers for home can prevent moisture damage and provide greater comfort for your life. Compressor free, no moving parts, an environmental friendly product.✿Our dehumidifier for bedroom is suitable for removing damp and moisture from home, small room, kitchen, bathroom, office, RV, wardrobes, caravans, storeroom,etc.➤Features:1. 900ml(31 oz) capacity water tank.2. Colorful atmosphere light.3.Auto-Off when water tank is full.(the YELLOW LED will on and the light shows red in the tank )3. One-button control, Energy efficient with low power consumption. 4. Compact, portable and lightweight moisture absorber.5. Ultra quiet design. No noise when you sleep at night.➤Specifications:1. Material:ABS plastic2. Power: 22W3. Voltage: 9V4. Size:6.1in*5.07in*8.74in5. Dehumidifying Capacity: Approximately 450ml per day at 30℃ (86℉), 80%RH7. Coverage area: 50sq ft - 190 sq ft (5㎡-18㎡）8. Working environment: Temperature：15℃-40℃ (59℉-104℉) Humidity ＞ 45%RH➤How to switch the colorful lightFirst press —— the dehumidifier turns on, 7 indicator lights alternateSecond press —— lock your desired colorThird press —— turn off the lightsFourth press —— Turn off The dehumidifierPlease note:1. Keep the front inlets and top outlets free from being blocked when the dehumidifier is working.2. Pour the water out when you don't need to use the dehumidifier.3. This is a small dehumidifier for small spaces, the dehumidify capacity is limited compared with the compression type.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610JoG70hSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUATK","source_asin":"B09CKNB7D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKNB7D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKNB7D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
