window.products.push({"id":1100176,"name":"Stunning Glass Globe Teapot with Cozy Warmer, High-Quality Borosilicate Glass, Beautiful Chrome Finish Teapot – 9cm Stainless Steel Infuser, Large Eno","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DDPZfp6zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE CONDUIT TO YOUR WELL-BEING ...WITH PRODUCTS THAT STEAL THE SPOTLIGHT! A BEAUTIFUL DESIGN MADE TO SHINE ON YOUR TABLE -Our bobuCuisine’s graceful teapot offers handcrafted charm and comes with a lovely matching cozy that keeps tea warm longer. -It is constructed of hand blown glass. -It includes a stainless steel infuser so you can view the steeping process as it takes place. -Simply place tea leaves inside the insert, then fill the pot with hot water and place the infuser inside the pot. -Allow tea leaves to steep for as long as you like, depending upon your personal preferences. The pot is attractively constructed of high quality glass and beautiful chrome plating -The cozy warmer is black which adds to the beauty of this tea pot and comes with a heavy duty zipper with large pull so it’s quick and easy to remove. -The lid is attached to the handle so that you’ll never lose it. It easily lifts up out of the way when you need to clean the pot. Get fresh, delicious tea every time with our stunning tea pot and matching cozy. -The sleek spherical design will complement your kitchen and look attractive sitting on your countertops. -Now you can enjoy a refreshing cup of tea whenever you like with our beautiful contemporary teapot and matching cozy. -How to clean? Simply hand wash with a wet cloth, rinse infuser under warm water. Dishwasher safe, although we suggest hand washing Our mission is to create health-related products with stylish designs to make your kitchen look great. We’ve succeeded. Order your Chrome Glass Tea Pot Globe today for yourself, or more for friends and family! With our ironclad warranty, you have nothing to lose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DDPZfp6zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bobucuisine","source_asin":"B01AOPBTDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AOPBTDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AOPBTDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
