window.products.push({"id":1100195,"name":"48\" HEAVY DUTY Round Closet Rod w/Matching Support Flanges | 1 5/16\" Diameter | Polished Chrome Clothes Pole | 2 Rods","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WttWn97gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Desunia is pleased to offer this beautiful clothes rod which will look great in any closet... especially yours! Strength You Can Count On! This is something that may not be apparent until you actually feel the heft of it in your hand. This rod is made from steel that's a robust .050\" thick. Bring on those heavy winter coats! Beautiful Finish The heavier steel that goes into our closet poles is the perfect foundation for a fantastic finish. Some manufacturers apply the chrome plating as soon as the raw goods leave the steel mill. Not us! We always polish our rods first, and THEN apply a generous chrome plating. The resulting finish is practically mirror-like, and will last for many years! Support Flanges Included No need to hunt high and low for end cups, because everything is included right here as a complete kit! So rest easy, knowing that each component will fit like a glove. Oh, and don't forget that our end brackets are made with the same care and have the same flawless finish as the rods themselves. There's even a handy set screw to keep everything in place once you're done! Nice! EZ Installation - If installing over wood, just attach the flanges at the appropriate location with the provided ¾” screws.- If going over sheet rock, use the provided hollow wall anchors and the included longer screws.- When you cut the rod to length, try this pro-tip... wrap some masking tape around the rod a few times in the location where the cut will be. This makes it much easier to mark and also prevents the hacksaw from \"wandering\" as you start the cut. Here's What You Get - 2 Chrome closet rods (48\")- 2 Polished chrome end supports- 8 Chrome Screws (¾\" long)- 8 Chrome Screws (1 1/8\" long)- 8 Hollow wall anchors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WttWn97gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Desunia","source_asin":"B0BBPYC7XV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBPYC7XV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBPYC7XV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
