window.products.push({"id":1100201,"name":"Authentic Chinese Bamboo Food Steamer with Aluminum Rims and 2 Tongs - 2-Tier and 10 inch diameter - 2\" Deep Wooden Baskets Bamboo - Perfect for Food ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQlAtk-5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eating healthy is now easier than ever with Somex Creations’ Bamboo Food Steamer. Enjoy tasty and nutritive foods by steaming your favorite meat, fish, dumplings or vegetables in this authentic chinese bamboo steamer, all without leaving the comfort of your home! EAT HEALTHIER: When boiled, some nutrients leach out of the vegetables and into the cooking water. The longer they cook, the more nutrients escape. However, unlike boiled vegetables, steamed veggies are cooked briefly and then removed from the heat. During steaming, the heat of the steam cooks the veggies, and they are spared from the boiling water.The goal of steaming is to cook the vegetables until they are no longer raw, but still bright and crisp. Steaming vegetables therefore preserves color and flavor, and more nutrient content. SIMPLE AND FAST COOKING: Most veggies and fishes take between 5 and 12 minutes only to be cooked by steaming. Just add a little seasoning first, whether that’s a sprinkle of salt or a squeeze of lemon juice, then start steaming! No need to adding fat or oil. MULTI-PURPOSE: From Thai inspired steamed fish and stuffed cabbage dumplings to Indian regional favourites like Bengali bhapa aloo and Parsi’s beloved snack patra, there’s plenty of dishes you can cook to surprise your family! DEEP BASKETS: Do not get fooled by other steamers with shallow baskets! Our baskets have an interior depth of 2 inches (5 cm) to ensure that all your favorite food fit in and can be cooked at the same time! ALUMINUM RIMS: Unlike steel rims which can rust over time, our rims are made of aluminum which can never rust. You will be amazed by the benefits obtained from steaming all your favorite foods in this autentic chinese steamer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQlAtk-5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Somex Creations","source_asin":"B01JKXAYZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JKXAYZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JKXAYZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
