window.products.push({"id":1100250,"name":"Huusk Japan Knife 8-inch Chef Kitchen Knife Professional Hand Forged Knife High Carbon Steel Sharp Japanese Gyutou Chef Knives for Meat Vegetables - W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JLKjV6jXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍄Multi-Functional Kitchen Knife🍄: 8.26-inch Chef Knife, Japanese Gyutou Knives is Classified and Designed to Be a Multipurpose Chef Knives. The Arc-Shaped Blade Design of This Huusk Knife Reduces The Resistance to Pressing Down, Making it More Labor-Saving When Useing, You Can Use it to Slice, Chop, and Dice Meat, Vegetables, and Fruits. Huusk Japan Knife is Easy to Hold, Easy to Maneuver, and Easy to Use, You Can Fully Enjoy The Fun of Cooking. 🔪 Sharp🔪. High Carbon Steel Chef Knife was forged by a Traditional Hot forging Process Combined with The Latest Heat Treatment Technology and is Sharp and Durable. Hand-forged to Make The Blades Even Harder and Unique Aesthetic, The Professional Design with Carbon Steel Makes it Very Easy to Sharpen and Stay Sharp for a Long Time. Note: High Carbon, No Chromium Metal; Maintenance: Hand-Wash and Wipe Dry; and Oil the Knife Regularly. 🐟Nicely Shaped and Textured Handle🐟: Pakka Wood Handle with Ergonomic Design, Professional Design Made These Japanese Chef Knives Comfortables to Grip and Easy to Control, Every Knife Feels Like an Extension of Your Hand While Using. Natural Birchwood is Added with a Polymer Resin and Then Pressed Under High Pressure to Produce a Very Dense and Durable Material That Exhibits Natural Beauty and, Although a Woody Material, is Also Capable of Working in Wet Environments. 🎁a Nice Gift for Those Who Enjoy Cooking🎁: Our Huusk Chef Knives are Not Only Fit for Professional Chefs But Also Amateur and Beginner Chefs, The 242g Will Be a Comfortable Weight for Most People to Use. These Unique Knives are Kitchen Gifts for Birthdays, Weddings, Christmas, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Anniversaries Etc, a Surprise for Friends Who Getting Serious about Cooking, and for Yourself. Each Huusk Japanese Chef Knife Comes in a Box, Which is Very Convenient for Gift Giving. 💕Huusk Guarantee💕: As a Professional Huusk Kitchen Knife Manufacturer, We Focus On offering High-Quality Kitchen Knives. We Also Provide a 12-Month Warranty for Quality-Related issues, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee for any reason and Friendly Customer Service. If You Have any Questions About Our Knives, Please Get in touch with Us, We Will Solve Your Problem within 24 Hours. Welcome to Buy and Receive Your Stuff.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JLKjV6jXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huusk","source_asin":"B0BG8FQNNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG8FQNNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG8FQNNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100251,"name":"Corelle 16-Piece Dinnerware Set Service for 4, Chip Resistant, Glass, Stone Grey, Vitrelle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XGuhFav1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Corelle Stone Grey 16pc Dinner Set Corelle glass dinnerware is designed to make an impact and take one. The patterns are inspired by the latest trends in fashion and home decor, delivering a variety of styles that will make a statement in any household. Every piece of Corelle glass dinnerware is break- and chip-resistant, making it perfect for everyday dining and entertaining proving once again that beauty can be tough. Everybody has their own sense of style, which is why Corelle dinnerware is offered in so many different patterns and shapes. But one thing everybody agrees on is durability. Dinnerware needs to last. Corelle plates and bowls are made from a unique material called Vitrelle, which gives them that legendary Corelle durability. It also gives them a number of other benefits that other brands can't offer. • Dishwasher Safe • Microwave Safe • Lightweight • Stackable • Patterns are Fade Resistant • Chip Resistant • Break Resistant Tempered Glass • 3 Year Limited Warranty Corelle dinnerware is created using a hub lamination process that fuses multiple layers of glass together to create a lightweight, yet durable glassware that is break and chip resistant. The result is a beautiful dinnerware set that is as stylish as it is functional. We stand behind our dinnerware with a 3 year break and chip limited warranty. The ergonomic design makes it easy to handle. It also allows the dishes to stack neatly to conserve space. Warranty Information World Kitchen, UK will replace any item of Corelle Vitrelle glass dinnerware that should crack, break or chip within THREE YEARS from date of purchase. PORCELAIN AND STONEWARE MUGS ARE NOT INCLUDED. If the exact item is not available, it will be replaced with a comparable item. This warranty only applies to products damaged during normal household use. It does not cover damage resulting from misuse, negligence, accidental breakage or attempted repair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XGuhFav1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B08C7Z5VT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C7Z5VT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C7Z5VT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
