window.products.push({"id":1100276,"name":"Plant Based Pros Alkaline Water Filter Pitcher - 2.5L Healthy Pure Water Ionizer, Two 60-Day Activated Carbon Filters, BPA Free, Healthy, Clean, Toxin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E4CSt8l6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FIT FOR REFRIGERATOR – 2.5L capacity alkaline water pitcher easily fits in door of most refrigerators. Pitcher comes with filter change reminder on lid to ensure high quality drinking water. Timer shows when you changed filter and helps track replacement time. You will receive two long-lasting and easy-to-install filters that last a total of 120 days (600L / 160 Gal). COMPOSITE 6 STAGE FILTER CARTRIDGE – A specially formulated six-stage filter removes chlorine, heavy metals, and other contaminants from water and increases the pH up to a 8.5-10 (depending on the water source). It also adds calcium, magnesium, and potassium minerals and anti-oxidants, and provides a low negative ORP around -100 mV. IMPROVED HYDRATION – The Plant Based Pros alkaline water pitcher micro-clusters and reduces the size of the water molecule so the water absorbs easily and hydrates you faster. The ionized water reduces toxins and free radicals and is a powerful antioxidant to enhance energy levels and improve your immune system. SAFE MATERIALS – The pitcher is made out of BPA free and food grade materials. The pitcher and filters are 100% recyclable and 100% vegan. It comes with a covered easy pour spout to keep dust and other contaminants out of your water. You will have perfect water for a hot tea or cold refreshing drink. GREAT TASTING WATER – Taste the difference of alkaline water in your sports drink, coffee, iced tea, lemonade, or favorite drink. Alkaline water reduces the high acidity commonly found in drinks. Your alkaline water pitcher will produce amazing tasting water that is good for you and will make everything taste better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E4CSt8l6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plant Based Pros","source_asin":"B07XJZFDB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XJZFDB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XJZFDB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
