window.products.push({"id":1100454,"name":"Professional Mini-Serving Spatula, Stainless Steel Cutter and Serve Turner for Serving, Flipping or Cooking, Ideal for Brownies, Tiramisu, Cakes, Lasa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vDuGXJfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Function 3 in 1】 This stainless steel spatula can be used as a cutter knife, as a serve turner, and as a cooking spatula. 3 1/2\" blade with beveled edge is perfect for easily cutting and turning foods, ideal for dessert serving or cooking. 【Safe and Durable】 The blade body is made of food grade stainless steel, high hardness non-slip plastic handle, BPA free, 100% food safe, non-toxic and durable enough. The beveled stainless steel edge slides easily under the food for a perfect flip without damaging the food. 【Bevel Edge Design】 The sharp leading edge helps to cut various desserts or dishes smoothly, such as tiramisu, chocolate cake, lasagna, etc. The flat, flexible head slides easily under food for serving or flipping. 【Easy to Use】 Easy to clean, dishwasher safe, a kitchen must-have. The mini Serve Turner helps you easily turn foods: eggs, burgers, beef patties, cookies, brownies and more. Easily cut through brownies, lasagna and more. Contoured handle for a comfortable grip. 【Buy Risk-free】 The good helper for your kitchen! Our Mini-Serving Spatula offers professional technical support. If there is any problem with the product, please contact us by email, we will serve you wholeheartedly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vDuGXJfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ReneeChef","source_asin":"B0BF4TQ58D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF4TQ58D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF4TQ58D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100455,"name":"Five Queens Court Beaumont Cal King Comf Set, Champagne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":283.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1X3fyPsmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic meets modern in this tonal satin stripe with banded jacquard design. Tones of ivory and champagne combine to create this elegant coloration. The jacquard is puffed from a special washing technique that adds loft and dimension. The 4 pcs set includes: A uniquely designed comforter with a jacquard scroll band detail and subtle tufting showoff a lustrous satin weave. The box pleated bed skirt is edged with a scroll jacquard adding a modern touch. The pillow shams are a sleek and tailored design with mitered corners that combine a classic diamond pattern and bands of the dimensional scroll. The shams are finished with a fine satin cord and reverse to smooth solid fabric and use a hidden zipper as closures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1X3fyPsmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Five Queens Court","source_asin":"B07FWRB7CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FWRB7CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FWRB7CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100456,"name":"12oz Stainless Steel Insulated Coffee Mug with Handle, Double Wall Vacuum Travel Mug, Tumbler Cup with Sliding Lid, BLACK, 6pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J-Ubb540L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Essential 12oz stainless steel vacuum insulated coffee mug for home, travel, office, lounge, bar, restaurant and many other occasions.It can hold any hot and cold drink you like,it is also a perfect gift for Father's Day and Mother's Day. The characteristics of 12oz stainless steel vacuum insulated coffee mug: 1.Double-wall vacuum insulation.2.Food-grade 18/8 stainless steel.3.Coated powder sweat-free design.4.Grey transparent plastic sliding lid with a rubber gasket.5.Long and wide handle.6.Multiple colors to choose. Helpful Tips: 1.Hot contents can create pressure resulting in discharge of hot vapor.When filling vessels with boiling liquid, allow liquid to cool down with the lid off for at least 3 minutes before attaching the lid.2.There is sliding lid, it could be took apart and easy to clean.3.Wash in warm water, and leave to dry after washing.4.Handwash only,washing painted stainless-steel coffee mug in dishwasher could result in premature wear,discoloration, or pealing of paint.5.Always keep vessels out of reach of childern when filled with hot liquids.6.The coffee mug is insulated, don't drink hot drinks too quickly and watch out for high temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J-Ubb540L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALOUFEA","source_asin":"B08FB4CR6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FB4CR6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FB4CR6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
