window.products.push({"id":1100626,"name":"Expanda Mattress Pad Cover, Two Classic Contour Pillows and Cal-King 2 Inch Thick Charcoal Grey Gel Infused 4 Pound Density Memory Foam Mattress Bed T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JsOvPxAAL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This new Charcoal Grey Gel Infused Memory Foam's ability to be ultra responsive, cooling and reduce pressure points without limiting movement is one of the reasons so many people are using it to get the best night's sleep ever. Now you can enjoy the benefits of Gel without having to buy an expensive new mattress by adding this Charcoal Grey Gel Infused 4 Pound density memory foam mattress topper to your existing mattress. This topper will add an incredible layer of responsive, comfort cooling gel and increase the quality of sleep from your current mattress immediately. What makes this gel infusion different than conventional gel foams is that the gel is actually infused on the cellular level loading the struts of the foam, leading to a much more even distribution of gel and a much more durable foam with a faster recovery time so that you do not feel like you are stuck in a rut like traditional memory foam toppers. The Gel is specially formulated to contour to your body faster at any temperature, and will give you the extra comfort cooling responsiveness you need to get the best night's sleep possible from your current mattress. Environmentally friendly processes used to make our memory foam. This makes our toppers more \"green\" and eco-friendly, by the use of earth friendly processes. Our toppers have also earned the PURGreen certification, which means they are safe and free from harmful chemicals. PURGreen uses independent laboratories to test products and ensure they are manufactured without use of prohibited content such as ozone-depleting CFCs, PBDE fire retardants, lead, mercury and other unsafe materials. PURGreen also sets baseline requirements for foam physical performance that can contribute to foam comfort and durability.***There may be a new foam smell associated with your new topper; however, this odor is not toxic or harmful passing all EPA and CSPC standards. MADE IN THE USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JsOvPxAAL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Memory Foam Solutions","source_asin":"B01HH7VW1O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HH7VW1O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HH7VW1O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
