window.products.push({"id":1100760,"name":"4' x 6' Green LED Wide Angle Christmas Net Lights - Green Wire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.42,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mpt4a6jHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The FAST and EASY way to decorate trees, hedges, bushes and more in just minutes, simple and easy to use! These net style lights are perfect to use on bushes or other decorations that a string of lights just will not cut it for. Don’t limit the way you decorate to just string lights, these net lights are an easy way to complete your outdoor decorating. Product Features: Color: green bulbs / green wire Bulb size: concave wide angle Number of bulbs: 150 Total lighted area: 24 sq. ft. 24\" lead cord (from the plug to the first bulb) 8\" tail cord Additional Product Features: LED lights use 90% less energy. Durable non-glass replaceable bulbs. Cool to the touch. UL certified and approved for indoor or outdoor use If one bulb burns out, the rest will stay lit. Replacement bulbs and spare fuses included Contains end-to-end connectors which allows you to connect up to 17 sets together (not to exceed 210 watts) Wire gauge: 22 120 volts, 60 hertz, 0.1 amps, 12 watts Dimensions: 4' wide x 6' long. Material(s): plastic/wire","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mpt4a6jHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B073V9M9DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073V9M9DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073V9M9DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100761,"name":"ZARPAX Moisture Absorber Activated Charcoal 300g | Removes Moisture, Damp, Humidity & Odors | Activated Charcoal Odor Absorber | Moisture Trap for Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xWvvKEAoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFECTIVELY ELIMINATE MOISTURE: ZARPAX's moisture absorber with activated charcoal eliminates the problem of excess dampness and unpleasant odors in the home. Our convenient and easy-to-use moisture absorbers allow you to capture and lock away moisture from the air effectively. Perfect for small, enclosed spaces prone to high humidity including closets bathrooms, and kitchens, our moisture absorbers will free your home of excess moisture and odor. REFRESH YOUR ENVIRONMENT: Our moisture absorbers are composed of calcium chloride which proficiently absorbs and traps excess moisture rapidly, and activated charcoal helps eliminate and prevent bad odors. ZARPAX's humidity absorber features premium moisture-locking filter paper to ensure no water leakage, only a dry and fresh environment. SAFEGUARD YOUR HOME: Make excess moisture, humidity, and odors a problem of the past with ZARPAX's moisture absorber. Perfect for closets, bathrooms, and kitchens, it can also be used to safeguard important documents or inside boxes, containers, and other storage vessels to protect items from moisture damage. Safeguard your valuables with our moisture and odor eliminator. HOW TO USE: To use, lift the top cover of the moisture absorber & remove the seal (do not remove the white anti-leak membrane underneath.) Place the desiccant pack in the place you wish to dehumidify. Ensure it is on a level surface & the anti-leak membrane is facing upwards. Once the moisture absorber is in place, it can be left in place for up to 45 days & will gradually absorb excess moisture from the air. Once all the white crystals have dissolved, replace the absorber with a fresh unit. EXPERTLY CURB MOISTURE: Our activated charcoal absorbers are for single use and come in a set of 4. ZARPAX's water absorber has ample absorption capacity and can hold up to 20 fl oz / 600ml of liquid. Designed to be easily transported and stored, our 300g moisture absorbers are compact and lightweight. Get rid of excess moisture and keep your home or office dry and comfortable with our single-use calcium chloride moisture absorbers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91xWvvKEAoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zarpax","source_asin":"B0BTK6LK5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTK6LK5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTK6LK5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100762,"name":"HOMCOM Indoor 2 Piece Glider & Ottoman Adjustable Reclining Function with Rubber Wood Base and Cushion, Wood/Cream White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ntlZoTdCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imagine a summer night with a cool breeze, after dinner, what you really want to do is move a reclining chair in the yard and talking with your family. The stool is too hard, the sofa is too hot so HOMCOM glider & ottoman is your best choice. Rocking, talking, and counting stars will be a lovely moment in your memory.Features:- 2 piece glider & ottoman - Leisure, modern and good-looking decor fits living room, bedroom, balcony - Ergonomic backrest with 7 level reclining function from 110° to 144° - Thick padded cushion and armrest for excellent sitting experience - Skin friendly plush-touch fabric is soft and easy to clean - Storage pocket is helpful to hold little items - Rubber wood base ensures stable standing - Required simple assemblySpecifications:- Color: Wood, Cream White - Material: Fabric, Sponge, Wood - Overall Dimensions: 27.25\" W x 28.75\" D x 41\" H(Rocking Chair), 19.75\" W x 15.25\" D x 14.5\" H(Footstool) - Seat Size: 22\" W x 19\" D - Seat Height: 16.5'' - Weight Capacity: 264lbs(Rocking Chair), 132lbs(Footstool)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ntlZoTdCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMCOM","source_asin":"B08DT7183G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DT7183G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DT7183G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100763,"name":"XONOR Artificial Rose Flowers Fake Hydrangea Plants in Picket Fence Pot for Home Office Wedding Party Kitchen Windowsill Decoration (Purple, Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tV28oGaZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Artificial rose hydrangea flowers plants in wooden picket fence pot 1. Wooden fence pot dimension: 11.8'' (L)x 3.2''(W) x 3''(H) 2. Each flower branch has different dimension, the length can be adjustable, normally the length is approx. 5’’ to 6’’(maximum). 3. Please adjust flowers’ length when you put these flowers in the wooden fence pot, different size can bring more real view. Self-assembly, super simple creative work, do it now to get much fun and make your places more colorful. 1. The artificial flowers are self-assembly, so there is a fun creative element to it. You will enjoy arranging them together with your family or friends. Do it now, quick couple of minutes, you will make your places more colorful, beautiful & attractive. 2. Flowers can be removed from wooden fence pot, pot is also suitable for your other flowers. You may change flowers for the different season, different place, different mood. 3. This silk fake rose flower plant is made of high quality materials, it is easy to care and can keep bright and beautiful for a long time.  4. Suitable for home, kitchen, window sill, living room, window frame, dining table, office, balcony, bedroom, birthday, wedding party decoration. It can go anywhere and will definitely brighten the area. 5. These artificial flowers are the perfect gifts to your family, friends or colleagues, the flowers will invite compliments for sure. An absolute must have for anyone wanting a pop of color. Kindly Note: 1. Due to long-term packaging, there may be some smell, which can be disappeared for about 1-2 days. 2. The flower may be squeezed during transportation. You only need to adjust the trunk gap and the beauty will reappear. 3. If the flower head appears to fall off due to transportation reason, don't worry, it is very easy to install it back. 4. Please keep the wooden fence away from the water, rain, water is not good for the wooden fence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tV28oGaZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XONOR","source_asin":"B08ZHPF1MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZHPF1MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZHPF1MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
