window.products.push({"id":1100765,"name":"Sweet Fountains 16\" Deluge Home Stainless Steel Chocolate Fountain Party Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CY0yY+eDL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"If you want to have the newest chocolate fountain on the market, the Deluge home chocolate fountain is here! Modeled after our larger Deluge commercial chocolate fountain, this home chocolate fountain is guaranteed to be a hit at your party. Let the fun begin with an amazing new design and an array of fondue ideas including cheese, bbq sauce, hot sauce, marinara, ranch dressing, peanut butter, caramel and of course, chocolate. As with all chocolate fountains, we recommend using SF Signature Fountain Chocolate for proper flow. Party Pack Includes: -- One ''Deluge'' Home Chocolate Fountain - 16'' -- 3.5 lbs. SF Signature Dark Chocolate Fondue -- 100 6 Inch Bamboo Skewers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CY0yY+eDL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SF Signature","source_asin":"B00CLVREYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CLVREYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CLVREYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100766,"name":"Bachelorette Party Decorations All-in-one Kit - Bridal Shower Supplies incl: Bride to be Sash, Veil, Gold Banner, Photo Booth Props, Bride Tribe Flash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o+OYMg2jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"b>We know her big day is right around the corner and you don’t want her to get hitched without a perfect bachelorette/hen party. So, get a head start by ordering this classy bachelorette party kit which includes: 55 PC Bachelorette Party favors that include 12 white/pink colored balloons, 1 bride to be satin sash, 1 double layered white veil with comb, 2 pre-strung banners, 10 fancy photo-props, 6 gold team bride tattoos and 1 gold bride headband. You see, a defective item inside a box can be a horror story for the bride. She deserves compliments on this day (instead of worrying about a loose thread or an entangled banner!). So, here's what we have done to make sure we meet your expectations: 1. Each and every letter on the banner is pre-strung on a thick string which makes it sturdy and easy to hang on a wall. This means you save more time and focus on more important things (like posing with your girls squad!).  2. Scentless latex balloons (unlike others who smell like gasoline and ruins the environment) . 3. A lot of bachelorette party kits in the market have items that are jam-packed and squished together which damages delicate items like banners and props. This is not the case with us. Our items are first packed inside separate polythene bags and then each item is enclosed in a beautiful pink box that is easy to carry. If you are a bridesmaid, maid of honor or even a bride-to-be - we want to make you a promise: \"Whether its a bachelorette party, pre-wedding engagement or your bridal shower - each of our item is designed to make your day less hectic and more special. From banner to photo booth props - these items will create memories you will cherish later on. However, if due to any reason you are not 100% satisfied with our product - you are free to ask for a refund. \" Try us. Yo have nothing to lose!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o+OYMg2jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICHELE","source_asin":"B07H9DFTQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H9DFTQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H9DFTQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100767,"name":"Pre-Seasoned Cast Iron Skillet 12.5 inch with (FREE) 8 inch Pan - Ultimate Heavy Duty Professional Restaurant Chef Quality Pre Seasoned Pan Cookware S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZrjdE5A8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amsha Kitchen Cast Iron Skillet 2-Piece Set (12.5 inch, 8 inch Pans) This 12.5” and 8” skillets will last for decades and continue to provide excellent performance year after year. This Amsha Kitchen cast iron skillet set is the perfect choice for searing, sauteing, simmering, braising, baking, roasting and frying. The rugged cast iron construction heats slowly and evenly. Not only can you fry chicken and eggs, you can bake biscuits, cakes and breads on the 12” & 8 ‘ Cast Iron Skillet! You will find it perfect for use at home on any cooking surface stovetop (electric, gas or induction), on the grill or over the campfire. No other cookware has the same heat retention as cast iron. Now let's eat! 2” Deep - Safe for cooking on all cooking surfaces: electric, gas and induction stovetops, oven, fire and grill - Seasoned cast iron is the original nonstick surface - Cast iron is best for even heating and heat retention - Cast iron is an excellent source of nutritional iron - Natural Healthy Cooking - Cast iron is economical and durable - Must-have for every kitchen! - Makes a great gift All our cast iron cookware is LEAD, PFOA and PTFE FREE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZrjdE5A8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amsha Kitchen","source_asin":"B071W745KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071W745KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071W745KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100768,"name":"The Wizard of Oz™ (S6) Framed and Matted Genuine Film Cell Minicell USFC5095","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617HBAx4DTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This 1939 Academy Award winning film was based on the ever-popular L. Frank Baum book, The Wonderful Wizard of Oz. This film stars Judy Garland as Dorothy Gale, a young girl from Kansas, who with her little dog Toto, is whisked away via a cyclone to the magical Land of Oz. There she embarks on an incredible adventure in search of a way back home to Kansas, making three close friends along the way. Ray Bolger stars as the Scarecrow, Jack Haley as the Tin Man, and Bert Lahr as the Cowardly Lion. If only the merry group can reach the man with all the answers, the Wonderful Wizard of Oz, before the nasty Wicked Witch of the West destroys them all. 7\" x 5\" 35 mm Film Cell Clips Special Edition Framed *7\" x 5\" *35 mm Film Cell Clips *Special Edition *Framed The film strip portrayed in the image above is only an example of the film cells you may receive. Please note, the cells may vary from piece to piece because they are hand selected from reels of film This item contains clips of film, an image portraying the movie(s), artist(s) or character(s) and a stunning descriptive plaque. These elements have been double mounted and placed within a beautiful black wood frame. Each item comes with an official Trend Setters Ltd. certificate stating its authenticity. THE WIZARD OF OZ and all related characters and elements are trademarks of and Turner Entertainment Co. Judy Garland as Dorothy from THE WIZARD OF OZ.(s10)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617HBAx4DTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FILMCELLS","source_asin":"B002EX6CWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002EX6CWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002EX6CWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
