window.products.push({"id":1100794,"name":"Dualshine Musubi Mold 5 Pcs Musubi Maker Kit Sushi Mold Making Kit Musubi Press(non Stick) Onigiri Rice Ball Mold Maker BPA Free Cheese Luncheon Bread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RAR0I-m2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【 Musubi Mold Kit Includes】You will receive 5 pcs musubi press molds for you to DIY: 1 all-in-one meat slicer which is designed double-folded, 2 triangle rice ball maker molds, and 2 musubi molds. Our musubi maker kit is right for you to slice lunch meat quickly and make rice balls to entertain your family or friends 【Safe and Quality Materials】The butter slicer is made of stainless steel, not easy to break or deform. The sushi molds are made of PP material. None toxic, BPA-free, safe material, you can use our set without the worry 【Simple Steps】Sushi Making Kit: Place the food you want to slice, such as meat, bread, eggs, or vegetables on the bottom of our adjustable meat press mold for deli meats, and then pull down the wire section; use either rectangular or triangular mochi rice molds, depending on your appetite and preference, when you want to make rice balls, put the food into the mold and press to get them 【Easy to Make Sushi at Home】Nothing tastes better than fresh sushi. You can cut fruit with our stick butter slicer, and make delicious and fresh sushi at home with our BPA-free musubi molds, healthy and hygienic. These onigiri molds feature an upgraded bump-point design (including lining and bottom), making its surface non-stick and easy to demold 【Ideal for Food DIY】You can use our musubi slicer to cut lunch meat, bananas, boiled eggs, soft cheeses, and other foods, and also make a variety of rice balls and sushi with the bento rice molds. It would be a nice choice to make delicious food for your family. Note: Not suitable for cutting particularly hard food with the musubi cut","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RAR0I-m2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dualshine","source_asin":"B0BX8CR7QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX8CR7QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX8CR7QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1100795,"name":"Generic Hinihao 1 pc Peacock Animal Patch Sticker Stick on/Iron on/Sew on Patch Applique for Clothes,Backpack,Phonecases,Helmat,DIY Accessories 101","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rdz3E5BFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's A Sticker And Also An Iron Patch!!! Color:As Shown Material:Fabric(Can be stick on,sew on or iron on) Size:As Shown ; Please follow these steps on how to use the sticker at frabic: Peel off the doublesided tape and stick the sticker on an object you prefer. Prepare an iron and set the temperature to around 150 degrees. Cover the sticker with an ironing cloth andiron the sticker back and forth for about 2025 seconds. Let it cool down to achieve firming results.It’s important to cover the sticker with an ironing cloth to prevent high temperature ruining the sticker. After the sticker has become stuck to the object, if it’s on cloth, you may choose to use a needle and thread to stitch the sticker firmly in place. For sweaters, leather, mesh, and smooth or rough fabrics, it is recommended that you fix the sticker in place with needlework rather than ironing. Caution: It’s not edible. Be aware of the heat from the iron. All children under the age of 13 must be accompanied by an adult when attaching the sticker. People with no experience making things with their hands should seek help from experienced people. ;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rdz3E5BFS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B096LMZS9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096LMZS9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096LMZS9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
