window.products.push({"id":1100804,"name":"Heartsforlove Metatron's Cube 6\" Gold Plated Sacred Geometry Grid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EMPaICWXL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Metatron's Cube sacred geometry pattern is believed by some to originate from the Flower of Life and is said to contain the Platonic Solids. Some scholars feel that by study of the Metatron's Cube, one can attune themselves to higher, positive forces in the universe. This piece has been laser cut in exquisite detail from brass and then plated with 18 karat gold. This Metatron's Cube is a two-dimensional geometric plate that is laser etched, cut and created from 13 equal circles with lines from the center of each circle extending out to the centers of the other 12 circles. Six circles are placed in a hexagonal pattern around a central circle, with six more extending out along the same radial lines.*Note: Due to it's highly reflective nature the photo was taken at a slight angle to capture the best likeness of this piece. This design is geometrically perfect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EMPaICWXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heartsforlove","source_asin":"B06XF68SVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XF68SVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XF68SVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
