window.products.push({"id":1100863,"name":"HIHIYO Weighted Blanket Kids 5 Pounds Twin, Reversible Minky Toddler Weighted Blanket, Baby Heavy Weighted Blanket, Child Weighted Blanket 5 lb, Washa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819et+eP1-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does your baby have difficulty falling asleep? Are you looking for a quick solution to improve your children’s sleep quality?Many studies show that lots of kids have difficulty falling asleep nowadays which will influence children’s attention, social skills, behavior, and learning abilities dramatically.HIHIYO kids weighted blanket is specially designed to solve this difficulty. The blanket will let them calm down and sleep quickly. Certified as safe for kids, it truly is the security blanket for kids. Reversible Practical DesignThe weighted blanket combines a natural high-quality cotton top with small dot reverse. The former is skin-friendly, breathable, and comfortable, while the latter provides a soft touch and the raised dots play a comforting role and give the child an extra sense of security to promote faster and more sound sleep. Stay in place 1. 4 x 4 inch pockets to keep the glass beads in place and evenly distribute the weight.2. Twin needle stitch sewing prevents the beads from shuffling around between each pocket. A Perfect Gift We deliberately designed various popular cartoon characters such as dinosaurs, owls, unicorns, rockets, and animal world cartoons to cater to children’s preferences perfectly. Our weighted blanket will be a perfect New Year and Christmas gift. Notes 1. Weight: Select a blanket that’s 10% of your baby’s weight plus or minus 1 pound. Please start with a lighter one if unsure.2. Adaption Time: It may take about 1 week to get used to the weight of this blanket.3. Care: Machine wash in cold water, tumble dry on low setting, do not iron. To extend its lifetime, recommend using it with a duvet cover. Warning 1. Do NOT cover the kid's face with the blanket to avoid choking.2. Please Keep away from fire, heater, or other heat sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819et+eP1-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIHIYO","source_asin":"B094RBBP4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094RBBP4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094RBBP4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
