window.products.push({"id":1100973,"name":"Serenia Sleep Cooling Mattress Pad King Size, 12-Inch Quilted Plush Mattress - Cool Gel-Infused, Deep Pocket, & Extra Thick Memory Foam Mattress Pads ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hiIFg2IAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete Comfort: Serenia Sleep Quilted Foam Mattresses provide comfort without sacrificing support thanks to Active Response Foam – a latex alternative — along with contoured gel memory foam and a soft, quilted cover. Your mattress will arrive compressed and roll packed. Simply unroll and let it expand to its proper height within 2 days (usually sooner). If there is a slight odor, it should dissipate in 24-48 hours. 4 Luxurious Layers: This mattress starts with high-density base foam for support, followed by Active Response (latex alternative) foam for recovery and support and gel memory counter contour foam. It’s finished with a quilt top featuring 3 layers of foam and fiber for added comfort and pressure point relief. Find Your Perfect Match: Choose from 10-, 12-, and 14-inch depths and Twin (39” x 75”), Twin XL (39” x 80”), Full (54” x 75”), Queen (60” x 80”), King (78” x 80”), and California King (72” x 84”) sizes. CERTIPUR-US Certified Foams: Serenia Sleep mattress are made in the USA by American craftsmen using domestic and imported components. Spot clean only – do not remove the cover. Sweet Dreams Await You: Serenia Sleep's team of engineers crafts quality mattresses using cutting-edge foam technology to create extraordinary comfort for everyone. Our mattresses are assembled in the US and made with high-quality materials. You can sleep soundly on your Serenia Sleep mattress, knowing that we treated it as if it were going to our own home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hiIFg2IAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serenia Sleep","source_asin":"B01H65JVZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1100973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H65JVZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H65JVZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
